  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be useful for a group to be able to feature a world playlist on the group, that group admins or moderators have the ability to add/remove worlds from. For groups centered around a specific activity, they could put worlds for that activity in the group's world playlist. All minigolf worlds in a playlist for a group centered around mini golf. A group of pilots might like to maintain a playlist of their favorite worlds with flying prefabs. A world explorer group could add their favorite worlds recently visited to a playlist for other members to visit.",
